{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"war-card-game UI copy.fields.summary","detected_language":"ms","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"war-card-game.copy.fields.summary","keys":["war-card-game.copy.fields.summary"],"locale":"ms","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Satu dek kad ZXQPH0000QXZ, tiada joker. Berikan secara sama rata kepada pemain ZXQPH0001QXZ–ZXQPH0002QXZ; simpan satu kad untuk tiga pemain. Kad tertinggi menang setiap putaran; warna tidak penting. Ace tinggi, ZXQPH0003QXZ rendah. Jika seri, setiap pemain dalam pertempuran meletakkan satu kad ke bawah dan satu ke atas. Kad muka atas tertinggi mengambil semua. Jika anda tidak dapat menyelesaikan perang, anda kalah. Permainan boleh panjang dan kebanyakannya bernasib baik.","record_id":"1cf755f0c74b38a1a87b4520bd9b5a99d63df3b8866594cb37bad8934510f43d","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":2.701445469499987,"source":"One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"1d2ad24094c0a116a056a7c33eca4bc529af719cccd080059fe2e87004f523b7","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Satu dek kad 52, tiada joker. Berikan secara sama rata kepada pemain 2–4; simpan satu kad untuk tiga pemain. Kad tertinggi menang setiap putaran; warna tidak penting. Ace tinggi, 2 rendah. Jika seri, setiap pemain dalam pertempuran meletakkan satu kad ke bawah dan satu ke atas. Kad muka atas tertinggi mengambil semua. Jika anda tidak dapat menyelesaikan perang, anda kalah. Permainan boleh panjang dan kebanyakannya bernasib baik.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
